    "TitleKey": "Headhunters_DefendDestructibleEntites_E_Title_001",
    "DisplayTitle": "Protect Fuel Tanks From Luggers",
    "Description": "Some morons with some seriously inflated notion of their place in 'verse made the damn foolish choice of attacking the <EM>~mission(Objects)</EM4> at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4>. We've got some things in play over there so we can\u2019t let \u2018em get away with it.\n\nIf you're interesting in helpin' out, get there and deal with these luggers before they can do too much damage. Don't figure you'll break too much of a sweat dealin' with them.\n\nAlso, I\u2019ll sweeten the pot by giving the main contractor <EM4>~mission(ScripAmount) Council Scrip</EM4> just to show my appreciation. \n\nStows out.",
    "DescriptionKey": "Headhunters_DefendDestructibleEntites_E_Desc_001",
    "DisplayDescription": "Some morons with some seriously inflated notion of their place in 'verse made the damn foolish choice of attacking the <EM>Fuel Tanks</EM4> at <EM4>Asteroid Mining Base</EM4>. We've got some things in play over there so we can\u2019t let \u2018em get away with it.\n\nIf you're interesting in helpin' out, get there and deal with these luggers before they can do too much damage. Don't figure you'll break too much of a sweat dealin' with them.\n\nAlso, I\u2019ll sweeten the pot by giving the main contractor <EM4>[ScripAmount] Council Scrip</EM4> just to show my appreciation. \n\nStows out.",
